.DS_Store

# Local agent state, machine-specific settings and worktrees. The two entries
# below are re-included because a rule cannot resurrect a file whose parent is
# excluded, and both of them are meant to be reviewed: settings.json is the
# permission grant, and skills is the symlink that points .claude at .agents.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills
